Subject: [PATCH] style: soft gradient Sankey with inline labels (cashflow
 card)

- Pale source-to-destination gradient ribbons instead of solid fills
- Rounded, slightly wider nodes; labels sit beside nodes (left/centre inline,
  right labels right-aligned) like the reference design
- Mono values, sans names, surplus highlighted in emerald
- Hover tooltips (<title>) and role/aria-label for accessibility
